LinuxTag is Europe's largest annual linux exhibition, now taking place
in Karlsruhe in Germany until Saturday.

Please make the effort to visit if you live near, and introduce yourself
at the Red Hat stand!  We're running a demonstration of GFS clustering.

Friday (tomorrow) is the best day for LVM & clustering:
  11:00
     Enterprise Clustering with GFS
     Lars Herrmann, Red Hat
       Room: UG1 - Thoma

  15:00
     device-mapper & LVM workshop
     Erik Tews, Christophe Saout, Alasdair Kergon
     Room: To be confirmed: meet by the Internet cafe near the 
     entrance to the Kongresszentrum.

  17:00 
     Kernel Kwestioning

There's also a Hacking Contest each day.

